{
  "id": 1173,
  "description": "# Welcome in Masters of None\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Masters of Bane🔸\n\n🔸Alt Guilds: Seekers of None, Adepts of None, Elites of None🔸\n\nWe plan to build up the Alt Guilds with the following Structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-40 -&gt;  Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nFor now all Alt Guilds have a no Requirements to join, as we&#039;re still building them from the ground up.\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 70🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Stockpile and Challenges if possible🔸\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity🔸\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ⚔️Raids &amp; Assault⚔️\n\nMonday-Friday: 3 Raids Per Day\n\n🔸Raid 1: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 18:00-18:55 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 2: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 19:05-20:00 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 3: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 20:10-21:05 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n\nSaturday-Sunday: 3 hours Assault\n\n🔸Time: 18:00-21:00, Location: Eldoria. Remember to prepare Food and Mobs.🔸\n\n##### ⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n###  📦Stockpile📦 \n\nTake a quick look at the stockpile, see what we’re low on, and deposit only what you can to help replenish it. These contributions help cover our guild’s repair costs. It’s not required, but even small, regular donations are really appreciated. Only Logs and Bars can be deposited. Longterm Goal is to have 30K from every Resource.\n\nCurrent Material priority for the last Building Slot:\n\nLogs:🔸Mahogany Log🔸Mystical Log🔸\n \nMetal Bars:🔸Chromite Bar🔸Mystic Bar🔸 \n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
